	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - USB DEV\n\nDEV DOMAIN - powered from Dev USB-C VBUS via LDO (3V3_DEV). Must not back-power target.\nDev USB-C receptacle (UFP, 5.1k Rd on CC) -> ESD -> USB2514B 4-port hub (24 MHz xtal).\n  Port1: P4 USB-Serial/JTAG (FS)\n  Port2: C6 USB-Serial/JTAG\n  Port3: FT4232H (93LC56 EEPROM)\n  Port4: spare / M1421 USB (TBC)\nFT4232H: A=M1421 JTAG (MPSSE), B=M1421 UART, C=P4 UART0 + DTR/RTS auto-reset, D=C6 UART0 + auto-reset.\nAll FT->target signals through SN74LVC2T45-type buffers powered from target side (B side = target rail)."
